<title>MOROCCO: Morocco fuel stations to close in one-day protest.</title>
<headline>Morocco fuel stations to close in one-day protest.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's 1,800 petrol stations will close for one day on March 24 in protest at contracts between them and supplying companies, a spokesman for the garage owners federation said on Friday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said: &quot;We want revision of contracts we have with fuel companies.&quot;</p>
<p>He said the federation included all Morocco's fuel stations which employed a total of 25,000 people.</p>
</text>
